      "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:18:00.781Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/alizabrookst\">@alizabrookst</a></p>\n<p>The Notification Module can trigger emails for sales invoice doctype days before due date as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/7/e713684dc2b528abf8a082781782e9afde1c886a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e713684dc2b528abf8a082781782e9afde1c886a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e713684dc2b528abf8a082781782e9afde1c886a_2_690x403.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wYbSj10reTvDmWejUo8pZokdtTc\" width=\"690\" height=\"403\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e713684dc2b528abf8a082781782e9afde1c886a_2_690x403.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e713684dc2b528abf8a082781782e9afde1c886a_2_1035x604.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e713684dc2b528abf8a082781782e9afde1c886a_2_1380x806.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1522×890 63.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The Notification Frappe Documentation may also help;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/notifications\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/notifications</a></p>\n<p>you should also check process statement of account which can also throw emails with SOA for each customer in a semi automatic way.</p>",
